# Validate a planned trajectory against conservative safety limits.
#
# The safety node never executes a trajectory. It checks state freshness,
# joint position limits, velocity/acceleration limits, start-state consistency,
# duration and the Cartesian workspace, then reports a veto or approval.
moveit_msgs/RobotTrajectory trajectory
# 0.0 means "use the configured default".
float64 max_start_state_distance_rad
---
bool approved
string code
string[] violations
# Full structured report, JSON-encoded (schema_version, checks, statistics).
string report_json
